    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. one thing though, we've noticed that sometimes the inventory counts in our system just don't match what's actually on the shelf, even when we're pretty sure the staff is being careful. like, we'll have a recorded 50 units left but when we check, it's actually 42. it's almost like stuff is just disappearing. how should i account for those kinds of discrepancies in my safety stock calculations?",
